# Markup Style

Follow `STYLE_GUIDE.md` (HTML, CSS, and JavaScript Markup section).

## Do Not Add Unless Specified

- Animations and transitions (`transition`, `animation`, `@keyframes`)
- Drop shadows (`box-shadow`, `text-shadow`, `filter: drop-shadow`)
- Gradients (`linear-gradient`, `radial-gradient`)
- New fonts, colors, borders, or border-radius values

Reuse project-provided colors, buttons, fonts, border radius, and other UI tokens.

## Spacing

- Use consistent vertical spacing between sections across the site
- Use consistent vertical spacing between paragraph-level items (headings, paragraphs, lists)
- Only break spacing patterns when the design explicitly calls for it

## CSS Sizing

- Prefer **px** for layout, spacing, and dimensions (pixel-perfect)
- Avoid `em`, `rem`, and other relative units for sizing unless specified
- Adjust spacing per viewport with **media queries**, not relative units

```css
.section {
	margin-bottom: 40px;
	padding: 24px;
}

.section p + p {
	margin-top: 16px;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
	.section {
		margin-bottom: 24px;
		padding: 16px;
	}
}
```
